    "The rules for using CatsBlock Weather and the Agent." to arrayOf("CatsBlock Weather और एजेंट के उपयोग के नियम।", "Zasady korzystania z CatsBlock Weather i Agenta.", "قواعد استخدام CatsBlock Weather والوكيل.", "Mga panuntunan sa paggamit ng CatsBlock Weather at ng Agent.", "Οι κανόνες χρήσης του CatsBlock Weather και του Agent.", "De gebruiksregels voor CatsBlock Weather en de Agent.", "Regulile de utilizare a CatsBlock Weather și a Agentului.", "Các quy tắc sử dụng CatsBlock Weather và Agent.", "CatsBlock Weather 和 Agent 的使用规则。"),
